      <ul><li><a href="https://www.thehindu.com/news/national/kerala/crime-branch-nabs-psc-additional-secretary-r-hari-in-examination-irregularities-case/article71646325.ece" rel="noopener">The Hindu</a></li></ul>
      <p>AI-generated and fact-checked against the original report; claims the gate cannot verify are held back.</p>
    </div>
       
