      <ul><li><a href="https://www.crictracker.com/cricket-news/india-register-second-biggest-defeat-in-t20is-as-new-zealand-dominate-in-auckland-2510/" rel="noopener">Crictracker</a></li></ul>
      <p>AI-generated and fact-checked against the original report; claims the gate cannot verify are held back.</p>
    </div>
       
