       <h1>‘Mothers of Courage,’ documentary on girls’ education in Bihar, wins UN SDG Action Award - The Economic Times</h1>
       <div class="tags"><span>#Documentary</span> <span>#Girls Education</span> <span>#Bihar</span> <span>#UN SDG Award</span></div>
       <p>The documentary ‘Mothers of Courage,’ focusing on girls’ education in Bihar, has achieved international recognition by winning the UN SDG Action Award. This accolade highlights the film's impact and its contribution to the Sustainable Development Goals.</p><img class="hero-art" src="/img/2026-10-30/mothers-of-courage-documentary-on-girls-education-in-bihar-w.webp" width="1200" height="675" alt="" loading="eager" fetchpriority="high" decoding="async"><p>The award acknowledges the documentary's powerful portrayal of efforts and challenges in advancing educational opportunities for girls in the region. The recognition was reported by The Economic Times.</p><p>What to watch: Further details on the documentary's reach and its influence on girls' education initiatives.</p>
       <p class="critique">Editor's note: The draft is a concise and accurate report based on the provided source summary.</p>
