      <a href="/feed.xml" title="RSS">RSS</a>
      <button id="tdp-theme" title="Toggle light/dark">Light</button>
    </div>
  </div>
  <nav class="catrow"><span class="catgrp"><b>News</b><a href="/category/national">national</a><a href="/category/world">world</a><a href="/category/defence">defence</a></span><span class="catgrp"><b>Money</b><a href="/category/business">business</a><a href="/category/finance">finance</a><a href="/category/education">education</a></span><span class="catgrp"><b>Sports</b><a href="/category/sports">sports</a><a href="/category/cricket">cricket</a></span><span class="catgrp"><b>Culture</b><a href="/category/entertainment">entertainment</a><a href="/category/positive">positive</a><a href="/category/funny">funny</a></span><span class="catgrp"><b>Life</b><a href="/category/science">science</a><a href="/category/environment">environment</a><a href="/category/space">space</a><a href="/category/health">health</a></span><span class="catgrp"><b>Tech</b><a href="/category/tech">tech</a><a href="/category/ai">ai</a></span></nav></div><div class="gtr"><span>Read in your language:</span><div id="google_translate_element"></div></div><div class="wrap"><main id="content"><p class="crumb"><a href="/">← Front page</a> · <a href="/archive">Archive</a> · <a href="/category/national">national</a></p>
     <article class="story single" data-beat="national">
       <div class="meta"><span class="beat-tag">NATIONAL</span> · The Hindu · 2026-10-30 · editor 10/10 · 1 min read <span class="badge ok">fact-checked</span><span class="badge quick">quick bite</span></div>
       <h1>Police conduct search at Bengaluru Central Prison</h1>
       <div class="tags"><span>#national</span> <span>#brief</span></div>
       <p>Police raided the Parappana Agrahara Central Prison in Bengaluru on Friday following multiple complaints of contraband found within the facility. The operation, led by Deputy Commissioner M. Narayana, involved 150 personnel searching barracks for several hours.</p><img class="hero-art" src="/img/2026-10-30/police-conduct-search-at-bengaluru-central-prison.webp" width="1200" height="675" alt="" loading="eager" fetchpriority="high" decoding="async"><p>Despite the extensive search, officials reported that no banned items or electronic devices were discovered. The raid follows several FIRs registered by prison authorities over the past two months regarding the presence of illicit materials. Prison officials reportedly cooperated fully throughout the surprise inspection.</p>
       <p class="critique">Editor's note: The report covers all key details of the police raid and its outcome concisely.</p>
       <div class="provenance">
      <b>Source</b>
      <ul><li><a href="https://www.thehindu.com/news/cities/bangalore/police-conduct-raid-at-bengaluru-central-prison/article71644733.ece" rel="noopener">The Hindu</a></li></ul>
      <p>AI-generated and fact-checked against the original report; claims the gate cannot verify are held back.</p>
    </div>
       <div class="cityguide"><b>City guide</b><p>More on <a href="https://bharatdn.com/city/bengaluru/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Bengaluru</a> - census 2011 population, live weather and air quality, local food and getaways.</p></div>
       <div class="sharebar" data-href="/article/2026-10-30/police-conduct-search-at-bengaluru-central-prison" data-title="Police conduct search at Bengaluru Central Prison"><b>Share:</b>
