       <div class="meta"><span class="beat-tag">DEFENCE</span> · Defence (aggregate) · 2026-10-30 · editor 9/10 · 1 min read <span class="badge ok">fact-checked</span><span class="badge quick">quick bite</span></div>
       <h1>Rafale Marine Jet Completes Trials on INS Vikrant</h1>
       <div class="tags"><span>#Rafale Marine</span> <span>#INS Vikrant</span> <span>#Aircraft Carrier</span> <span>#Naval Aviation</span></div>
       <p>The Rafale Marine Jet has successfully conducted its inaugural take-off and landing trials on India's Indigenous Aircraft Carrier INS Vikrant. These trials mark a significant milestone for the naval aviation capabilities of the Indian armed forces.</p><img class="hero-art" src="/img/2026-10-30/rafale-marine-jet-completes-trials-on-ins-vikrant.webp" width="1200" height="675" alt="" loading="eager" fetchpriority="high" decoding="async"><p>The successful completion of these initial tests on the indigenous aircraft carrier underscores progress in integrating advanced combat aircraft with India's domestically built naval assets. The trials demonstrate the operational compatibility between the Rafale Marine Jet and the INS Vikrant.</p><p>What to watch: Further integration of advanced aircraft with indigenous naval platforms.</p>
       <p class="critique">Editor's note: Concise and accurate reporting based on the provided summary.</p>
