      <ul><li><a href="https://www.thehindu.com/news/cities/Madurai/seeman-hints-at-accepting-the-support-of-dmk-and-aiadmk-in-ambasamudram-byelection/article71644538.ece" rel="noopener">The Hindu</a></li></ul>
      <p>AI-generated and fact-checked against the original report; claims the gate cannot verify are held back.</p>
    </div>
       
