     <article class="story single" data-beat="national">
       <div class="meta"><span class="beat-tag">NATIONAL</span> · News18 India · 2026-10-30 · editor 10/10 · 1 min read <span class="badge ok">fact-checked</span></div>
       <h1>South Central Railway Announces Festive Season Berth Availability</h1>
       <div class="tags"><span>#national</span> <span>#brief</span></div>
       <p>South Central Railway has released data regarding vacant berths on special trains operating through November for passengers traveling from Telangana to Delhi, Uttar Pradesh, Bihar, and Gujarat. As of October 28, availability remains for various routes, including daily services between Secunderabad and Sirpur Kagaznagar, such as train 07711 and 07712.</p><img class="hero-art" src="/img/2026-10-30/south-central-railway-announces-festive-season-berth-availab.webp" width="1200" height="675" alt="" loading="eager" fetchpriority="high" decoding="async"><p>Additional capacity is available on long-distance routes, including the Charlapalli-Hazrat Nizamuddin (07023), Charlapalli-Prayagraj (04122), and Charlapalli-Danapur (07049) specials. Other listed services include the Jalna-Chhapra, Charlapalli-Sasaram, and Charlapalli-Pratapnagar trains. Authorities advise passengers to book early, as real-time availability changes frequently due to high seasonal demand.</p>
       <p class="critique">Editor's note: The brief accurately reports the available data while correctly contextualizing the limitations of the information provided by the source.</p>
       <div class="provenance">
      <b>Source</b>
      <ul><li><a href="https://www.news18.com/photogallery/india/train-ticket-rush-during-festive-season-check-available-berths-on-these-special-trains-shil-ws-l-10404549.html" rel="noopener">News18 India</a></li></ul>
      <p>AI-generated and fact-checked against the original report; claims the gate cannot verify are held back.</p>
    </div>
       
